Connect 4 Bot

A command-line Connect 4 game with perfect play.

How it works:
- Bitboard representation of game states
- Negamax search w/ alpha-beta pruning and transposition table
- Pascal Pons' precomputed early game opening book for O(1) lookup

Requirements:
Python 3.x

File Structure
main.py           - gameplay loop
board.py          - board class, bitboard logic
solver.py         - negamax solver
opening_book.py   - opening book loader/query
data/7x6.book - precomputed opening book

Credit / References
- Opening book by Pascal Pons
(blog.gamesolver.org)